cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss Plectis, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "Plectis"
abstract: "A public executable cross-section of an AI-native workflow and research runtime: 88 bounded components spanning formal proof, agent reliability and safety, research and forecasting, projection-drift control, validators, work landing, and continuity. Each component names the code it runs, a typed evidence class, a local receipt, and an explicit authority ceiling where its result stops. A local Python command-line tool exercises them and, pointed at a project, writes an inspectable record beside the source it reads. It runs entirely on your machine."
